  "_notes": {
    "last_verified": "2026-10-20",
    "source": "Live https://blueguardian.com/ plan selector read in Chrome on 2026-10-20 (CFD and Futures, every plan; each size button shows the discounted and full price), https://blueguardian.com/affiliates, help.blueguardian.com 'How to become an Affiliate?', Trustpilot (20 newest reviews) and Google Maps. Earlier sources (2026-10-11) listed in git history.",
    "pricing": "standard = original price, promo = discounted price as displayed on each size button (25% off with code SPOOKY, shown site-wide on 2026-10-20; it replaced BG25). Prices are the same on every platform. A few promo prices moved by $1 against the earlier page data (rounding), Futures Reserve 50K changed from $112/$84 to $125/$94, and the Instant $300K is no longer offered (removed).",
    "profit_split": "profit_split_max = the standard split without paid add-ons (help centre): Instant 80% (90% add-on), 1-Step Standard 85% (90% add-on), 1-Step Nano 85% (100% add-on), 2-Step Standard 85% (90% add-on), 2-Step Nano 80%. Futures 90%.",
    "rules_detail": "Forex daily loss resets at 5pm EST from the higher of balance or equity. Minimum days are profitable days: Instant 5 (before payout), 1-Step and 2-Step Standard 3, 1-Step Nano none in the evaluation and 5 on the funded account, 2-Step Nano none. Consistency: Instant 20%; 1-Step Nano 50%; 2-Step Nano 50% on the funded account only. Futures: Standard has no consistency rule in the evaluation and 40% on the funded account; Reserve and Express have 40% in the evaluation only; Direct (no evaluation) uses 20% / 25% / 30% for payouts 1 / 2 / 3+, and a profit goal of $1,500 / $3,000 / $6,000 / $9,000 for the first payout.",
    "payout_caps": "Futures Standard: first payout cap recorded ($1,500-$4,000), then $2,000-$4,500. Express: maximum daily payout ($600-$2,500). Reserve: flat cap per payout. Direct: no cap shown.",
    "not_listed": "Fast Track, Buy Now Pay Later, Instant Starter and legacy plans (1-Step Pro, 2-Step Pro, 3-Step) are not listed.",
    "payout_wording": "The site advertises a '24hr payout guarantee' (processing speed). We don't repeat this wording.",
    "company": "Footer: products and payment processing provided by Iconic Exchange FZCO, IFZA Business Park, DDP Dubai, UAE. No founding date stated on an official page.",
    "vetting": "Checked 2026-10-11. Of the 20 newest Trustpilot reviews, about 11 described a rejected payout (reasons given include 'multiple accounts'/CID violations, a failed video or KYC check and the 'Guardian Shield' rule); the firm replied to 1. Trustpilot hides its score for a guideline breach and says it removed fake reviews. Listed with a review alert at the team's request (2026-10-11): the site aims to list every firm and show this context.",
    "logo": "No square logo found (the site uses an inline wordmark); the card shows initials.",
    "rule_units": "Forex rules are % of account size. Futures rules are fixed USD amounts.",
    "null_means": "Not stated on an official Blue Guardian page we could read.",
    "affiliate_program": "https://blueguardian.com/affiliates and help article 'How to become an Affiliate?' (2026-10-20): Level 1 (0-100 referrals) 10%, Level 2 (100-250) 12.5% plus a $500 bonus and free accounts, Level 3 (250+) 15% plus $1,000 bonus; strong existing affiliates can apply straight to Level 3. 30-day cookie; commission on sales through the affiliate link or coupon code. Minimum payout $200, paid on the 15th and 30th of each month (method not named). Free to join, anyone can apply; social media promotion allowed; paid ads allowed except Google Ads/PPC; no self-referrals. Comparison sites and country limits not mentioned. Apply: form on https://blueguardian.com/affiliates.",
    "google_rating": "Google Maps (2026-10-20): 'Blue Guardian' listing (category 'Educational institution', website blueguardian.com) - 4.7 from 343 reviews. The pin sits near Abu Dhabi rather than at the footer's Dubai address."
  },
